    "explanation": "The identity provider (idp.example) started responding slowly (lines 77, 80) and then hanging until auth-svc's 30s timeout, which made account-svc's calls to auth-svc time out too (lines 84, 85, 97, 98). Pool saturation in account-svc (lines 101, 108) is resource_exhaustion but secondary, and the edge-proxy 503s (lines 96, 106, 114, 117) are the paging symptom. external_outage is defensible since the third party is degraded, but the observable failure is hanging calls, so dependency_timeout is the best label.",
